    "result_text": "The implementation is complete. There's a single test class (`AcceptanceTest`) with 2 tests, both passing, and `BUILD SUCCESS`.\n\n## Summary\n\nI implemented `contactPreference` to return `EMAIL` when an owner has an email, otherwise `PHONE`.\n\nTwo changes, following the existing pattern used by the other derived Owner fields (`locality`, `membershipLevel`, etc.):\n\n1. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 added a read-only `contactPreference` string property to the `Owner` schema, so the generated `OwnerDto` exposes the field.\n\n2. **`src/main/java/.../mapper/OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 added `@Mapping(target = \"contactPreference\", expression = \"java(contactPreference(owner))\")` on `toOwnerDto`, plus a `contactPreference(Owner)` default method returning `\"EMAIL\"` when the email is non-null/non-blank, else `\"PHONE\"`.\n\nBoth acceptance tests (`corePhoneWhenNoEmail`, `functionalityEmailWhenPresent`) pass: `Tests run: 2, Failures: 0, Errors: 0`.",
